maksu etsiv\u00e4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5s9bVQj6de0Q7kNvwF7CBND&_nc_oc=AdoxWrlbIGwDXt8M6ET3U50bFRZzL13UiiWFvtiAxhtqcKuDqg5fS4X-MtULReI6AJ0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af52cg9UAokQSK3A7tO10eFsXQckhvMj1rGOkpV3O2rZAQ&oe=6A11A5D4"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QwQujaYROmQQ7kNvwE0kLFs&_nc_oc=AdobEwpLZac3oeFsNIs0fqQoCJygZmWQ6_i43bGgoY0-0_3ItiCdc7U_5B4qLmNN7e0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4mgMEawm8dp6UuEKFLaCdi5LQhB80b5wckjxGMgMVTEg&oe=6A11AAB2"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=t9_PK_Ui-90Q7kNvwEjfz7R&_nc_oc=AdoOjMce7fK5og5wSsZJgz593qKMIeGzIEJfIQeK2twrgxXElHNq94CkKkuo-xEsEwM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7-qQlwMgTZNxkvQVo8VHPoAraesWdRpMkgCzL2vrAWfg&oe=6A11B855"}, {"file_name":